# Event Reminders (Watermelon UI — Animated)
Source: https://ui.watermelon.sh/animated-components/event-reminders
CLI: npx shadcn@latest add https://ui.watermelon.sh/r/event-reminders.json
Dependencies: motion/react, lucide-react, react-icons, motion
