# Quick Option Picker (Watermelon UI — Animated)
Source: https://ui.watermelon.sh/animated-components/quick-option-picker
CLI: npx shadcn@latest add https://ui.watermelon.sh/r/quick-option-picker.json
Dependencies: motion/react, lucide-react, react-icons, motion
